              "ev-a870611aae1b-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, what does it mean that a mixed actor has its own speech, and does that affect government speech?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a870611aae1bda5ee688b19c191430b90cee6d6b8b491398aa82939446ef9252",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a870611aae1b-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, do you have the power to schedule topics for discussion at specific times?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a870611aae1bda5ee688b19c191430b90cee6d6b8b491398aa82939446ef9252",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a870611aae1b-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, could you have just sued the city and not MNN?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a870611aae1bda5ee688b19c191430b90cee6d6b8b491398aa82939446ef9252",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a870611aae1b-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 67,
              "start": 67
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, if the government imposes a first\u2011come\u2011first\u2011served requirement on a private company, what are the implications?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a870611aae1bda5ee688b19c191430b90cee6d6b8b491398aa82939446ef9252",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a870611aae1b-0003-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 71,
              "start": 71
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, how do the many arrangements between government and private parties, ranging from agency to corporate, affect the analysis?"
      }
    ],
