            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 34,
              "start": 34
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Hughes, petitioners argue that the channel lacks discretion to decline to run content that is protected by the First Amendment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a870611aae1bda5ee688b19c191430b90cee6d6b8b491398aa82939446ef9252",
